{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_howto_answer

    One answer of «How is it done?», as a slip of the desk: a task or a setting, its first step (or, on a yellow
    note, what it waits for), its value now for a setting written by hand, and the stub to tear, «Go» or «Change». The
    whole slip is one link, so the hand finds it anywhere; inside an item of a list. The script of the panel draws the
    same in the sheet of the bar (howtoDraw).

    Example context (json):
    {"key": "costs", "setting": true, "kind": "Ajuste", "text": "Lo que cuesta", "value": "sí",
        "sub": "En «Ajustes», «Lo que cuesta».", "wait": false, "url": "#", "go": "Cambiar", "help": false}
}}
<a class="como-r{{#setting}} como-ajuste{{/setting}}" href="{{url}}">
    <span class="como-tipo">{{kind}}</span>
    <span class="como-titulo">{{text}}</span>
    <span class="como-sub{{#wait}} como-espera{{/wait}}">{{sub}}</span>
    {{#value}}<span class="como-valor"><span class="como-valor-l">{{#str}}panel_howto_now, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span> <span class="como-valor-v">{{value}}</span></span>{{/value}}
    <span class="como-talon">{{go}}<span class="como-flecha" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
</a>
